stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> Released: release (artwork approved if required)
  Draft --> Cancelled: cancel (reason)
  Draft --> [*]: delete
  Released --> InProgress: first operation started
  Released --> OnHold: hold (reason code)
  InProgress --> OnHold: hold / QC fail
  OnHold --> Released: resume
  OnHold --> InProgress: resume
  Released --> Cancelled: cancel (no completed step)
  OnHold --> Cancelled: cancel (no completed step)
  InProgress --> Cancelled: cancel (no completed step)
  InProgress --> Completed: last operation completed
  Completed --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]
